/**
 * ARBITER 1, as a standing gate policy rather than only an emitter precondition.
 * `frameless-angular-v1` T002 ruling 4 makes it PRIMARY and requires it be
 * asserted as an EXACT EMPTY error set over all three templates: it interrogates
 * this board's central risk directly - did forced lowering produce a template
